    "text": "1 days ago MILAN, Italy — The Winter Olympics are nearly upon us ... and KARE 11 Sunrise anchor Alicia Lewis will be there to cover the Games in person. As Italy is known for its delicious pasta dishes and refined dining culture, Lewis — whose flight leaves on Friday — talked with a few experts about what to know when dining in Italy before she hops on the plane. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
